### Product Service - try it with the REST Client extension (click "Send Request" above each block)
### Start infra first:  cd infra; docker compose up -d --wait
### Start the service:  .\mvnw.cmd -pl product-service -am spring-boot:run

@base = http://localhost:8081

### 1. Search: category + price range + pagination (Mono.zip runs content + count in parallel)
GET {{base}}/api/products?category=books&minPrice=100&maxPrice=200&page=0&size=5

### 2. Search by name (case-insensitive "contains")
GET {{base}}/api/products?q=item 0001

### 3. Create - returns 201 + Location header
# @name created
POST {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "DEMO-100",
  "name": "Reactive Spring in Action",
  "description": "Interview prep",
  "category": "books",
  "price": 39.90
}

### 4. Get by id (uses the id from request 3)
GET {{base}}/api/products/{{created.response.body.id}}

### 5. Update details (price is NOT part of PUT)
PUT {{base}}/api/products/{{created.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "DEMO-100",
  "name": "Reactive Spring in Action, 2nd ed.",
  "category": "books"
}

### 6. Change price -> also pushed to every SSE client on /api/catalog/price-updates
PATCH {{base}}/api/products/{{created.response.body.id}}/price
Content-Type: application/json

{ "price": 29.99 }

### 7. Duplicate SKU -> 409 (enforced by the unique index)
POST {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{ "sku": "DEMO-100", "name": "Copy", "category": "books", "price": 10 }

### 8. Validation error -> 400 with one violation per field; correlation id echoed back
POST {{base}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-123

{ "sku": "", "name": "x", "category": "books", "price": -1 }

### 9. Unknown id -> 404
GET {{base}}/api/products/000000000000000000000000

### 10. Delete -> 204
DELETE {{base}}/api/products/{{created.response.body.id}}

### 11. Stream the whole catalog as NDJSON (functional endpoint)
GET {{base}}/api/catalog/stream
Accept: application/x-ndjson

### 12. Same stream, slowed down so you can watch it arrive line by line
###     (REST Client buffers responses - for a live view use a terminal:
###      curl.exe -N "http://localhost:8081/api/catalog/stream?delayMs=50")
GET {{base}}/api/catalog/stream?delayMs=20
Accept: application/x-ndjson

### 13. Bad parameter on a functional route -> 400 from the router's onError
GET {{base}}/api/catalog/stream?delayMs=abc

### 14. Live price updates (SSE). Open in a TERMINAL, then run request 6 again:
###     curl.exe -N http://localhost:8081/api/catalog/price-updates
